OL,3,GNEWSAWomen targeted by police who
OL,4,A'abused the badge'
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo women who were preyed upon by
OL,7,Fserving police officers they trusted
OL,8,Fhave described their ordeals and why
OL,9,Fthey decided to speak out.
OL,11,FNaomi Meadows was raped by a detective
OL,12,Fshe met online in Devon, while
OL,13,FCatherine Dobson was subjected to years
OL,14,Fof coercive and controlling behaviour
OL,15,Fby a Lancashire police officer who
OL,16,Fworked in a sexual offences unit.
OL,18,FCatherine said: "He used his job, he
OL,19,Fused his power and he abused the badge.
OL,20,FWhatever his motives were, I will never
OL,21,Funderstand."
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
