OL,3,GNEWSAWomen targeted by police who
OL,4,A'abused the badge'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe women waived their right to
OL,7,Fanonymity to tell their harrowing
OL,8,Fstories as part of a BBC investigation
OL,9,Fthat uncovered more than 1,200 domestic
OL,10,Fabuse allegations made in three years
OL,11,Fagainst police officers and special
OL,12,Fconstables across England and Wales.
